      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TOMMY THE FROG (7) goes very well this course and distance starting nine times for four wins and two minors. Hit the frame latest (19.85) when second at this track in a Grade 5. Has the ability and looks a key chance here. SHREWD ETHICS (2) turned in a moderate run last time when seventh at this track over 431m behind Mully The Master (25.87) in a Grade 4/5. Has ability and can atone. HOLYFIELD CHIC (1) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing eighth (20.55) last time in a Grade 5 at this track. Form at the trip sound including three wins. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings five times from eight attempts. Cannot be taken lightly. FRAME SISTER (8) missed the placings here most recently but can sneak into the finish with the right run.",
